SUMMARY:20s & 30s: Trail Work Day at Noble View
LOCATION:635 S Quarter R\nRussell\, MA 01071
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, May 10\, 2026 | 9:00 AM\nhttps://activities.outdoors.
 org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX00000178Jd2AI/\nGet down\, get dirty\, get rockin'!
  It's trail work time!Join the squad and help install stonework steps on t
 he Border Trail at Noble View. We'll be focusing on installing check steps
  and other stone structures using rocks and dry-stone masonry techniques. 
 Exciting\, woo! All tools and PPE will be provided and instruction and tra
 ining will be provided on site. Do you have previous rock work experience?
  Cool! We'd love to have you apply it on this project. Have none at all? S
 till cool! You'll walk away knowing more about how stone work is installed
  on trails than you started with.FREE camping is available the night of Sa
 turday the 9th as well as Sunday the 10th at Noble View's campground if yo
 u want to spend some time in nature before or after this one-day work proj
 ect.Participants are responsible for bringing their own work clothes (pant
 s and boots required\, long sleeves recommended). Personal Protective Equi
 pment (PPE) will be provided by AMC Trails staff. Participants must also b
 ring their own trail lunch and water (or more if you plan on camping) but 
 after the workday is completed\, we'll head into town as group for a dinne
 r paid for by the Worcester Chapter as a thank you for your contributions 
 to the trail.All participants must be ready and able for a full work day o
 utdoors. This includes but is not limited to a 1 mile hike with loaded pac
 k\, work on your feet for multiple hours\, the ability to safely use hand 
 tools\, and the ability to follow instructions. The work party will be sup
 ervised by AMC Trails Department staff and the Activity Leader.This event 
 is intended as an affinity work trip for people in their 20s & 30s. If you
  are not a member of that group\, please do not sign up for this activity.
 Any questions at all\, reach out!
END:VEVENT
