SUMMARY:Worcester 20s & 30s May Social
LOCATION:539 Prospect S\nWest Boylston\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, May 21\, 2026 | 6:30 PM\nhttps://activities.outdoor
 s.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000016d4X2AQ/\nJoin us for our May social on May
  21 for ice cream at Pinecroft Dairy in West Boylston! It will start at 6:
 30pm but feel free to come whenever you can (Pinecroft is open until 8pm).
  Pinecroft also serves dinner food. Enjoy ice cream\, meet like-minded out
 door enthusiasts\, meet Worcester 20s & 30s leaders\, and learn about acti
 vities you can do with AMC this spring and summer. Everyone is welcome\, n
 ew and returning participants! We are a group within AMC that is dedicated
  to encouraging people in their 20s and 30s to enjoy the outdoors. 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a5UVX0000017CDZ2A2
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260510T025151Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
X-MICROSOFT-MSNCALENDAR-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
SUMMARY:20s & 30s  Mt Greylock Day Hike
LOCATION:Roaring Brook R\nWilliamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 23\, 2026 | 7:45 AM\nhttps://activities.outdoor
 s.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000017CDZ2A2/\nJoin us for a day hike up the tal
 lest mountain Massachusetts has to offer\, Mount Greylock! On a clear day\
 , the summit of Mount Greylock offers gorgeous 360-degree views of up to 9
 0 miles\, including nearby peaks in Massachusetts\, Vermont\, and New Hamp
 shire.This will be a vigorous hike covering 8.5 miles with 2\,600 feet of 
 ascent. Be prepared for steep terrain. We will hike at a moderate pace wit
 h time for breaks to enjoy the flora and fauna and take photos. Expect to 
 be on the trail all day. We will stop for lunch during the hike\, likely a
 t the summit.Sunday\, 5/24 is our planned “rain date\,” should we have
  to cancel on 5/23 due to e.g.\, poor weather.Additional information\, inc
 luding meeting time and place\, will be emailed to those who register. If 
 you have any questions\, please email one of the leaders.Please no dogs ex
 cept service animals.As an affinity group within AMC that is dedicated to 
 encouraging people in their 20s and 30s to enjoy the outdoors\, this is a 
 trip for those in their 20s and 30s.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a5UVX0000016iFV2AY
SEQUENCE:0
